   "reply_len": 325,
   "excerpt": "Porcelain is definitely the way to go there; it\u2019s practically indestructible and doesn\u2019t need sealing. It\u2019s like how honeybees seal their hive with propolis to keep moisture and pests out\u2014totally maintenance-free once it\u2019s in place. You should probably just grab some samples and head back out there before my ride gets here."
